         "title": "Le TOC et les troubles apparentés",
         "url": "https://www.psycom.org/sinformer/la-sante-mentale/les-troubles-psy/le-toc-et-les-troubles-apparentes/",
         "kind": "quote",
         "upd": "2026-07-06"
